{"id":"91aef0bb06ab9396","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-simple-not-creative.md","title":"Simple Set Not Creative","display":"thm-simple-not-creative — Simple Set Not Creative","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-simple-not-creative","aliases":["92-thm-simple-not-creative"],"display":"thm-simple-not-creative — Simple Set Not Creative","depends_on":["[[92-df-simple-set]]","[[92-df-creative-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-simple-not-creative"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-simple-not-creative</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-simple-not-creative — Simple Set Not Creative"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c973cbf3deff3126\" href=\"?note=c973cbf3deff3126\" title=\"92-df-simple-set\">92-df-simple-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c9d6396579de4ff0\" href=\"?note=c9d6396579de4ff0\" title=\"92-df-creative-set\">92-df-creative-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> (set parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Simple}\">\\(\\mathrm{Simple}\\)</span> (simple-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c973cbf3deff3126\" href=\"?note=c973cbf3deff3126\" title=\"92-df-simple-set\">92-df-simple-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Creative}\">\\(\\mathrm{Creative}\\)</span> (creative-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c9d6396579de4ff0\" href=\"?note=c9d6396579de4ff0\" title=\"92-df-creative-set\">92-df-creative-set</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}simple\\text{-}not\\text{-}creative} \\vdash \\mathrm{Simple}(A)\\Longrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Creative}(A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}simple\\text{-}not\\text{-}creative} \\vdash \\mathrm{Simple}(A)\\Longrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Creative}(A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>简单集不是创造集</li>\n<li>简单集的补集没有无限r.e.子集</li>\n<li>创造集的补集是生产集；迭代生产力函数可在该补集中构造无限CE子集</li>\n<li>简单集的补集免疫，不含无限CE子集，因此不可能同时是创造集</li>\n<li>这表明不可判定r.e.集有不同的&quot;复杂度等级&quot;</li>\n<li>“简单”只排除了创造性（因而排除了c.e.多一完备性），并不自动意味着低Turing度</li>\n<li>该结果区分了两类不可判定c.e.集，但不把它们线性排列成唯一的复杂度尺度</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-simple-set","status":"resolved","id":"c973cbf3deff3126","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-simple-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-creative-set","status":"resolved","id":"c9d6396579de4ff0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-creative-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-simple-set","status":"resolved","id":"c973cbf3deff3126","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Simple}$ (simple-set predicate, see [[92-df-simple-set]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-creative-set","status":"resolved","id":"c9d6396579de4ff0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Creative}$ (creative-set predicate, see [[92-df-creative-set]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Simple}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Creative}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}simple\\text{-}not\\text{-}creative} \\vdash \\mathrm{Simple}(A)\\Longrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Creative}(A)","display":true}],"bytes":1238,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-187","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-ce-incompleteness.md]]\n[[92-thm-ch-independence.md]]\n[[92-thm-compactness.md]]\n[[92-thm-completeness-fo.md]]\n[[92-thm-consistency-addable.md]]\n[[92-thm-consistency-strength-hierarchy.md]]\n[[92-thm-craig-theorem.md]]\n[[92-thm-deduction-theorem.md]]\n[[92-thm-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[92-thm-essentially-undecidable.md]]\n[[92-thm-first-incompleteness.md]]\n[[92-thm-godel-incompleteness-general.md]]\n[[92-thm-godel-set-undecidable.md]]\n[[92-thm-halting-undecidable.md]]\n[[92-thm-incompleteness-recursive-extension.md]]\n[[92-thm-induction-axiom-decidable.md]]\n[[92-thm-k-g-equivalent.md]]\n[[92-thm-lob-theorem.md]]\n[[92-thm-m-complete-creative.md]]\n[[92-thm-numeral-injective.md]]\n[[92-thm-omega-incompleteness.md]]\n[[92-thm-pairing-bijective.md]]\n[[92-thm-pi1-incompleteness.md]]\n[[92-thm-pr-representable-detailed.md]]\n[[92-thm-pr-representable.md]]\n[[92-thm-reflection-undecidable.md]]\n[[92-thm-reflection-unprovable.md]]\n[[92-thm-representability.md]]\n[[92-thm-representation-strong.md]]\n[[92-thm-rice-theorem-arithmetic.md]]\n[[92-thm-rosser-incompleteness.md]]\n[[92-thm-schema-axiom-decidable.md]]\n[[92-thm-second-incompleteness.md]]\n[[92-thm-sigma1-completeness.md]]\n[[92-thm-simple-not-creative.md]]\n[[92-thm-sound-implies-consistent.md]]\n[[92-thm-substitution-representable.md]]\n[[92-thm-tarski-undefinability.md]]\n[[92-thm-truth-undefinable.md]]\n[[92-thm-turing-progress.md]]"}],"outgoing":["c973cbf3deff3126","c9d6396579de4ff0"]}